{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","title":"Tracker","symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Tracker"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"Tracker.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Tracker.swift#L55"},"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Tracker"}]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers"]]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What app code tracks events with: it records each event, with the time, the caller’s source"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"location and the task’s context, as one of its "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Trackers\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/withTracker(_:_:)-7fax9","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/withTracker(_:_:)-24yuc","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/TrackerAlreadyBootstrapped"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Tracking","title":"Tracking"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Tracker"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker is a value. Build one where the app starts, start delivering its records, and either"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pass the tracker down or bind it to a task with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"withTracker"},{"type":"text","text":" and read it anywhere inside with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/current","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let tracker = Tracker()","let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(to: ConsoleDestination())","withTracker(tracker) {","    Tracker.current.track(SignedUp(plan: \"pro\"))","}","await tracker.finish()","try await delivery.execute()"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Copies share one stream of records. A binding reaches the work run inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"withTracker"},{"type":"text","text":", and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the child tasks it starts, but not a detached task or callbacks a framework runs on tasks of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its own, such as a UI framework’s button actions: pass those a tracker, or make the app’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker the process’s default once, at launch, with "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/bootstrap(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", which "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/current"},{"type":"text","text":" falls"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"back to wherever no tracker is bound."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/track(_:file:fileID:function:line:column:)"},{"text":" does nothing but accept the event, from any","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"thread: it reads the clock, captures the call site and the task’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServiceContext"},{"text":", and queues","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"them. A worker the tracker owns, which never runs on the main actor, does everything else, in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the order events were tracked: the constraints’ check, the enrichers, the samplers, the consent,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a store’s writes, and publishing to ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property"},{"text":". No API runs that work on a caller’s thread. ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/flush()"},{"text":" waits for the worker to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"catch up; ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/finish()"},{"text":" does too, then ends the records.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tracked events wait in memory, without a bound, until the worker reaches them. The queue"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can’t be bounded without losing something it mustn’t: it also carries consent decisions and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the waits of "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/flush()"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"code":"track","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" can’t wait for room without blocking its caller."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Without a store, records live in memory only, and records not yet delivered are lost if the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"process exits. A tracker given a ","type":"text"},{"code":"RecordStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)"},{"text":")","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"delivers what the store kept from earlier runs first, and writes each record to it once the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"worker reaches it: a record is durable from then on, and one tracked moments before the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"process is killed, not yet reached, is lost.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A tracker given ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","type":"reference"},{"text":"s keeps a seeded fraction of the events they apply to, dropping the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rest before they are held, written or delivered and reporting them on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A tracker given a ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent","isActive":true},{"text":" delivers an event only once its category is granted, holding it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"while undecided and dropping it when denied; one given none delivers every event.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/Records-swift.struct"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Structures","title":"Structures"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/